<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατρέπω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τρέψω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.47.8
				</span></i>
			:—<i>turn away, deter from</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὰ τοῦ μὴ . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.4.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.87f
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πρὸς τὸ μὴ ἀπολιπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					1.6.10
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατρᾰπήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.), etc.: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διετράπην [ᾰ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.95
			</span></i>, etc.:—<i>turn aside from one's purpose,</i>
			Epicur.p.xxviii U.; <i>to be confounded</i> or <i>perplexed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.86.6
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ παντὸς δ. καὶ διαρρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					66.19
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>to be overawed by,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχλον . .,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Gnom.</u>
				65
			</span></i>; <i>avoid, refuse to face,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.532e
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pervert,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Critias
				<u>Fr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overthrow, do away with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.212
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				194
			</span></i>,al.</div>
